<br><br><b>&lt;Gasper&gt;</b> *aggredon* Anyone - will characters be able to hire NPC guards as escorts through 'wild-lands'?
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Not at ship, but they will be able to hire PC guards. =)
