safe/unsafe areas.
<br><br><b>&lt;Gasper&gt;</b> *m4l* Will my actual level number in Origin be visible to others?
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> No.  Level isn't necessary a useful stat to other players, since your character's worth is determined first 

