<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> We expect players to use their titles that they earned to identify the needs of their party, and the relative 

strength of other players.  
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Each skill box has the chance to give you a title, in case you're wondering how they are earned.
<br><br><b>&lt;Gasper&gt;</b> *Gonj* When will we get to see a map of Origin?
