<br><br><b>&lt;Gasper&gt;</b> *Hero* exactly how will the death system enforce your debt?
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> As you die, your debt accumulates.  The amount of debt you gain is based on how frequently you've died lately
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> The higher your debt, the more likely a stat penalty will be placed on you, and the worse that stat penalty 

will be.
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Death needs to have -some- bite, but a player who plays sensibly and dies fairly rarely will probably find 

the penalties almost negligable.
<br><b>&lt;Ubiq&gt;</b> Someone who can't learn when to say 'no', though.....
